                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Knows what he's talking about but spends a lot of time explaining one concept and then skips through slides to explain another concept at length. Goes through examples very quickly. Says the material is &quot;intuitive&quot; multiple times. Difficult to know what's important and what's not because he gets really into it and then says &quot;Where were we?&quot;",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 2
            },
